      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MISTER THREEOFIVE (9) is at the track for the first time. By top sire Captaintreacherous and hails from the Russell Jack stable. Has strong trial form coming into this, winning his latest hitout at Shepparton. Can travel in a nice spot from this draw and wait on the sprint lane if necessary so could kick off with a win. LANIKAI WARRIOR (5) has raced twice this campaign and has filled a minor placing on each occasion. Went well again last time at Ballarat, finishing second and a head from the winner. Draws wider but should be hitting his peak. KALIMBA (2) is going well, kicking off the campaign with back-to-back placings before a fourth here last time, all from wider draws than this. PERRYMAN (6) is a two-year-old filly on debut for the Jackson Painting stable. Has shown some ability at the trials so keep her safe.",
